      {
        "m_Id": 12346041565786112,
        "m_Localized": "Seems like the antenna up at the Silver Line Studio building is still holding up and we\u0027re still on the air. That studio is, of course, famous, or infamous if you like, for the Terminal Drive TV series. It put Silver Pines on the map, but it didn\u0027t do much to show its fine citizens in a very good light. That\u0027s water under the bridge. And Speaking of water, here\u0027s Stephen Waters and SunshineMelody.",
