      {
        "m_Id": 12346041586757633,
        "m_Localized": "This is why I never tire of broadcasting. Just a few moments ago I had a visitor here in my studio shack, a man on horseback, all dressed in white. I kid you not, he said to tell you all that he was out there keeping an eye on things. Isn\u0027t that something? Never a dull moment in Silver Pines.",
