      {
        "m_Id": 12346041599340544,
        "m_Localized": "Well, the hour is drawing to a close, wind howling outside my window. If you\u0027re still out there, I hope you find shelter soon and that whatever unfinished business you have gets resolved. I\u0027ll stay on for now, hoping to hear some good news.",
